markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Seeing the Filters

Filters shape what shows up in a feed, but they are not always easy to notice. In the last level, you compared two feeds and saw how filters can emphasize some ideas while leaving others out.

In this level, you’ll review a few key terms and think about how platforms can make filtering more transparent.

### **Terms to Know**

